# Ashen Tamper Alarm Driver
#

config ASHEN_TAMPER
	tristate "Ashen Sensor Heartbeat Protocol Support"
	select CRYPTO_LIB_CURVE25519
	select CRYPTO_LIB_CHACHA20POLY1305
	select CRYPTO_LIB_SHA256
	help
	  Driver for the Ashen tamper monitor, a microcontroller attached over
	  a UART that watches tamper sensors. The driver keeps an encrypted
	  Noise_XX link to the monitor and exchanges heartbeats with it. When
	  the monitor reports tamper or stops answering while the heartbeat is
	  armed, the driver panics the kernel so that a crash kernel can wipe
	  memory.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called ashen-tamper.
